  "description": "The new Zeus tank from GeekVape is the company’s sub-ohm version of their bestselling Zeus RTA X tank and delivers Olympian clouds and divine flavour in an easy to use, high-performance tank. Precision-engineered and exquisitely designed, the Zeus tank oozes GeekVape’s typical quality from high-end materials and iconic aesthetics. The tank features a top-fill refill system beneath a removable cap that reveals two large juice ports for easy, mess-free refilling. The Zeus’ tactile and smooth adjustable airflow lets you precisely hone the draw on the tank to deliver your preferred intensity of flavour and clouds. Changing coils is a breeze thanks to the Zeus’ pre-built coil system, and the Zeus is designed for use with GeekVape’s peerless Z mesh coils, available in Z1 0.4 Ohm or a Z2 0.2 Ohm. As a sub-ohm tank, the Zeus is best used with high-VG eliquids and is compatible with most mods with an 510 connection.",
